{"title":"1989 AHSME Problems/Problem 11","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1989_AHSME_Problems/Problem_11&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Let <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/7/d/c7d457e388298246adb06c587bccd419ea67f7e8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"10\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/1/3/8136a7ef6a03334a7246df9097e5bcc31ba33fd2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"10\" height=\"14\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/3/7/3372c1cb6d68cf97c2d231acc0b47b95a9ed04cc.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$c$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"10\" height=\"10\" />, and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/6/a/96ab646de7704969b91c76a214126b45f2b07b25.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$d$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> be positive integers with <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/b/d/1bde7ae0b83a0049bbf23bccc41aff3ffcdb6f38.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a &lt; 2b$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"51\" height=\"13\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/f/4/2f490418de32a973d77b73576b7ca1534f57c6e0.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b &lt; 3c$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"49\" height=\"13\" />, and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/e/9/fe9b45f3b463dc6e33811288003c11b778704b4a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$c&lt;4d$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"50\" height=\"13\" />. If <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/4/b/e4b076f21c4bfb955981a9e38d204a98248a624c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$d&lt;100$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"60\" height=\"13\" />, the largest possible value for <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/7/d/c7d457e388298246adb06c587bccd419ea67f7e8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"10\" /> is\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/a/2/9a27fd89f5e8ada4f588ddd779f9240bb3a30fd6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textrm{(A)}\\ 2367\\qquad\\textrm{(B)}\\ 2375\\qquad\\textrm{(C)}\\ 2391\\qquad\\textrm{(D)}\\ 2399\\qquad\\textrm{(E)}\\ 2400$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"466\" height=\"17\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1989_AHSME_Problems/Problem_11&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Each of these integers is bounded above by the next one.\n</p>\n<ul><li><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/4/b/e4b076f21c4bfb955981a9e38d204a98248a624c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$d&lt;100$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"60\" height=\"13\" />, so the maximum <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/6/a/96ab646de7704969b91c76a214126b45f2b07b25.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$d$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/3/1/a313bf06349648df7be807bee95b651604ce7a7e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$99$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" />.</li>\n<li><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/6/9/f6996342eeedc9a12e500841879c8c37788ab50a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$c&lt;4d\\le396$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"101\" height=\"15\" />, so the maximum <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/3/7/3372c1cb6d68cf97c2d231acc0b47b95a9ed04cc.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$c$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"10\" height=\"10\" /> is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/6/5/a654a0e4d9972299ad97dde6cf1d71521b73365a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$395$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"29\" height=\"14\" />.</li>\n<li><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/8/a/f8ac87159fbbea18293202bba0bef92bb88024f3.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b&lt;3c\\le1185$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"108\" height=\"15\" />, so the maximum <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/1/3/8136a7ef6a03334a7246df9097e5bcc31ba33fd2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"10\" height=\"14\" /> is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/e/d/dede4264dd5dd14a1acb2a2837276afe3b84b4d7.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1184$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"36\" height=\"13\" />.</li>\n<li><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/a/0/9a0cb63254a6ef2a32bf059553fac421ecb4c341.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a&lt;2b\\le2368$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"110\" height=\"15\" />, so the maximum <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/7/d/c7d457e388298246adb06c587bccd419ea67f7e8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"10\" /> is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/c/7/5c708b26c92e5112ddc0f988c044a381a194bb7d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{2367}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"48\" height=\"23\" />.</li></ul>\n<p>Note that the statement <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/a/9/ca9c507f70d119eb329e1f6c3ac9be9febce5a2d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a&lt;2b&lt;6c&lt;24d&lt;2400$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"203\" height=\"13\" /> is true, but does not specify the distances between each pair of values.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_also\">See also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1989_AHSME_Problems/Problem_11&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: See also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1989_AHSME\" title=\"1989 AHSME\">1989 AHSME</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1989_AHSME_Problems\" title=\"1989 AHSME Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1989_AHSME_Answer_Key\" title=\"1989 AHSME Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Forum/resources.php?c=182&amp;cid=44&amp;year=1989\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1989_AHSME_Problems/Problem_10\" title=\"1989 AHSME Problems/Problem 10\">Problem 10</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1989_AHSME_Problems/Problem_12\" title=\"1989 AHSME Problems/Problem 12\">Problem 12</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1989_AHSME_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"1989 AHSME Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1989_AHSME_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"1989 AHSME Problems/Problem 2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1989_AHSME_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"1989 AHSME Problems/Problem 3\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1989_AHSME_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"1989 AHSME Problems/Problem 4\">4</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1989_AHSME_Problems/Problem_5\" title=\"1989 AHSME Problems/Problem 5\">5</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1989_AHSME_Problems/Problem_6\" title=\"1989 AHSME Problems/Problem 6\">6</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1989_AHSME_Problems/Problem_7\" title=\"1989 AHSME Problems/Problem 7\">7</a> <b>